{"r":"Sld","lane":{"p":1715,"e":[{"h":"صَلَادَةٌ","t":["[inf. ns. of which the verb is ",[2,"صَلُدَ"],",] used in relation to a stone [&c.], signify The ",[1,"being hard and smooth."]," (M.) [And ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"]," has a similar meaning.] You say, ",[2,"صَلَدَتِ الأَرْضُ"],", and ↓ ",[2,"أَصْلَدَت"],", ",[1,"The land was,"]," or ",[1,"became, hard:"]," (K:) or (tropical:) ",[1,"so that it produced no plants,"]," or ",[1,"herbage:"]," (TA:) and ",[2,"صَلَدَ المَكَانُ"],", and ↓ ",[2,"أَصْلَدَ"],", (M, TA,) ",[1,"the place was,"]," or ",[1,"became, hard:"]," (TA:) or (assumed tropical:) ",[1,"produced no plants,"]," or ",[1,"herbage."]," (M.) And ",[2,"صَلَدَ عَلَيْهِ الجَبَلُ"],", aor. , inf. n. ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],"; and ",[2,"صَلُدَ"],", [aor. ,] inf. n. ",[2,"صَلَادَةٌ"]," and ",[2,"صُلُودَةٌ"]," and ",[2,"صُلُودٌ"],"; ",[1,"The mountain,"]," or ",[1,"rock, baffled him,"]," namely, a welldigger, [",[1,"by its hardness,"],"] ",[1,"and resisted his efforts."]," (M.) ― -b2- [Hence,] ",[2,"صَلَدَ الزَّنْدُ"],", (M, K, and so in some copies of the S,) aor. , inf. n. ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],"; (M;) or ",[2,"صَلِدَ"],", with kesr to the ",[2,"ل"],", aor. , inf. n. ",[2,"صُلُودٌ"],"; (AZ, S;) ",[1,"The"],[2,"زند"]," [or ",[1,"piece of stick,"]," or ",[1,"wood, for producing fire"],"] ",[1,"gave a sound without emitting fire;"]," (S, M, K;) and ↓ ",[2,"اصلد"]," signifies [the same, or] ",[1,"it emitted no fire."]," (Ham p. 407.) ― -b3- And [hence,] ",[2,"صَلَدَتْ زِنَادُهُ"]," [lit. “ His pieces of stick, or wood, for producing fire, gave a sound without emitting fire ”] means (tropical:) ",[1,"He was,"]," or ",[1,"became, niggardly, tenacious, penurious,"]," or ",[1,"avaricious:"]," (AA, L, TA:) and ",[2,"صَلُدَ"],", alone, aor. , (M, A, K,) inf. n. ",[2,"صَلَادَةٌ"],"; (M, A;) and ",[2,"صَلَدَ"],", (M, A,) aor. , (M,) or , (A,) inf. n. ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", (M,) or ",[2,"صُلُودٌ"],"; (A;) and ↓ ",[2,"صلّد"],", inf. n. ",[2,"تَصْلِيدٌ"],"; (K;) signify the same: (M, K:) or ",[1,"he was,"]," or ",[1,"became, very niggardly"]," &c. (A.) ― -b4- And ",[2,"صَلَدَتْ صَلَعَتُهُ"],", or ",[2,"صَلْعَتُهُ"],", (accord. to different copies of the K, in the TA the former,) ",[1,"The bald place on the front of his head shone,"]," or ",[1,"glistened."]," (K, TA.) ",[2,"صَلَدَ"]," is also used in the same sense, in a trad., in relation to milk flowing forth. (TA.) ― -b5- And one says, ",[2,"جَآءَ بِمَرَقٍ يَصْلِدُ"],", and ",[2,"بِلَبَنٍ يَصْلِدُ"],", meaning ",[1,"He brought broth,"]," and ",[1,"milk, containing little oily,"]," or ",[1,"greasy, matter, and much water:"]," for ",[2,"يَصْلِتُ"],". (T in art. ",[2,"صلت"],".) ― -b6- ",[2,"صَلَدَتْ أَنْيَابُهُ"],[1,"His canine teeth caused a grating sound to be heard."]," (K, * TA.) ― -b7- ",[2,"صَلَدَ بِيَدَيْهِ"],[1,"He clapped with his hands."]," (M.) ― -b8- ",[2,"صَلَدَتِ الدَّابَّةُ"],", aor. , (K,) inf. n. ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", (TA,) ",[1,"The beast beat the ground with its fore feet in its running."]," (K.) ― -b9- ",[2,"صَلَدَ"],", (M,) or ",[2,"صَلَدَ فِى الجَبَلِ"],", (K,) aor. , inf. n. ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", said of a mountain-goat, (M,) ",[1,"He ascended the mountain."]," (M, K.) ― -b10- ",[2,"تَصْلُدُ"],", [or probably ",[2,"تَصْلِدُ"],",] said of a wild cow or wild ox (",[2,"بَقَرَة وَحْشِيَّة"],"), in a verse ascribed to a Hudhalee, [but not found by SM in the Deewán of the Hudhalees,] is expl. as meaning ",[1,"She,"]," or ",[1,"he, stands erect."]," (TA.) -A2- ",[2,"صَلَدَ السَّائِلَ"]," (assumed tropical:) ",[1,"He gave nothing to the asker,"]," or ",[1,"beggar."]," (L.)"],"f":"1"},{"h":"صَلَّدَ","t":["see the preceding paragraph."],"f":"2"},{"h":"اصلد","t":[": see 1, in three places. ― -b2- Also (tropical:) ",[1,"He"]," (a man) ",[1,"failed to produce fire with his"],[2,"زَنْد"]," [or ",[1,"piece of stick,"]," or ",[1,"wood, used for that purpose"],"]. (S, A.) ― -b3- And ",[2,"اصلد زَنْدَهُ"]," (tropical:) ",[1,"He made his"],[2,"زند"],[1,"to give a sound without emitting fire."]," (M, TA.) And (tropical:) ",[1,"He"]," (God) ",[1,"caused his"],[2,"زند"],[1,"to emit no fire."]," (A.) And ",[2,"سَأَلَهُ فَأَصْلَدَ"]," (assumed tropical:) ",[1,"He asked,"]," or ",[1,"begged, of him, and found him niggardly:"]," thus related on the authority of IAar; but by rule it should be ",[2,"فَأَصْلَدَهُ"],". (M.)"],"f":"4"},{"h":"صَلْدٌ","t":[[1,"Hard and smooth;"]," (S, M, A, K;) as also ↓ ",[2,"صِلْدٌ"]," (K) and ↓ ",[2,"صَلُودٌ"]," (M) and ↓ ",[2,"صَلِيدٌ"]," (A) and ↓ ",[2,"أَصْلَدُ"],"; (M;) applied to a stone; (S, M, A;) and so the first applied to land or ground (",[2,"أَرْض"],"); (S;) and to a solid hoof, as also ↓ ",[2,"صِلْدِمٌ"]," and ↓ ",[2,"صُلَادِمٌ"],", which last is of the measure ",[2,"فُعَالِمٌ"]," accord. to Kh, but ",[2,"فُعَالِلٌ"]," accord. to others; (M;) and to a side of the forehead, (S, M,) or thus applied meaning ",[1,"smooth and tough;"]," (L;) and to a head, as also ↓ ",[2,"صُلَادِمٌ"],", (M,) or thus applied meaning (tropical:) ",[1,"upon which no hair grows:"]," (A:) and ↓ ",[2,"صَلَوْدَدٌ"],", (M, K,) which is of an extr. form, (M,) has the first of the significations above, (K,) or signifies [simply] ",[1,"hard:"]," (M:) the pl. of ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"]," (M, L) and of ↓ ",[2,"صَلُودٌ"]," (M) is ",[2,"أَصْلَادٌ"],". (M, L.) ― -b2- Also applied to a place, (",[2,"مَكَانٌ"],", M,) and ",[2,"صَلْدَةٌ"]," applied to land, (",[2,"أَرْضٌ"],", A,) (tropical:) ",[1,"That produces no plants,"]," or ",[1,"herbage."]," (M, A.) And ",[2,"أَصْلَادُ الجَبِينِ"]," (tropical:) ",[1,"The part of the side of the forehead upon which is no hair:"]," likened to smooth stone. (A Heyth.) ― -b3- [Hence,] ",[2,"حَجَرٌ صَلْدٌ"]," and ↓ ",[2,"صَلُودٌ"]," (tropical:) ",[1,"A stone that will not emit fire:"]," (L, TA:) and ↓ ",[2,"زَنْدٌ صَلُودٌ"]," (M, A) and ↓ ",[2,"صَالِدٌ"]," and ↓ ",[2,"صَلَّادٌ"]," and ↓ ",[2,"مِصْلَادٌ"]," (M) [and ↓ ",[2,"مُصْلِدٌ"],"] (tropical:) [",[1,"A piece of stick,"]," or ",[1,"wood, for producing fire"],"] ",[1,"that gives a sound,"]," (M,) ",[1,"not emitting fire:"]," (M, A:) and ↓ ",[2,"عُودٌ صَلَّادٌ"]," (tropical:) ",[1,"Wood,"]," or ",[1,"a stick, from which fire cannot be produced."]," (T, L, K. *) ― -b4- And ",[2,"فَرَسٌ صَلْدٌ"]," (K) and ↓ ",[2,"صَلُودٌ"]," (S, M, A, K) (tropical:) ",[1,"A horse that does not sweat:"]," (S, A, K:) such a horse is discommended: (K:) or ",[1,"slow to sweat:"]," or ",[1,"having little seminal fluid:"]," and ",[1,"slow in impregnating."]," (M.) ― -b5- And ",[2,"رَجُلٌ صَلْدٌ"]," (M) and ↓ ",[2,"صَلُودٌ"]," (M, A) and ↓ ",[2,"أَصْلَدُ"]," (S, M, A, K) (tropical:) ",[1,"A niggardly, tenacious, penurious,"]," or ",[1,"avaricious, man:"]," (S, M, K:) or ",[1,"a man very niggardly"]," &c. (A.) ― -b6- And ",[2,"نَاقَةٌ صَلْدَةٌ"]," (tropical:) ",[1,"A hardy, strong, enduring she-camel."]," (K.) And ",[2,"خَيْلٌ صِلَادٌ"]," (tropical:) ",[1,"Hard, hardy,"]," or ",[1,"strong, horses."]," (A.) [And ↓ ",[2,"صِلْدَامٌ"],", also, signifies ",[1,"Robust,"]," or ",[1,"strong."]," (Freytag, from Jereer.)]"]},{"h":"صِلْدٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", first sentence."]},{"h":"صِلْدَآءٌ","t":["and ",[2,"صِلْدَآءَةٌ"],[1,"Rugged and hard ground,"]," (ISk, K,) (assumed tropical:) ",[1,"that produces no plants,"]," or ",[1,"herbage."]," (ISk.)"]},{"h":"صِلْدِمٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَفْدٌ"],", first sentence."]},{"h":"صِلْدَامٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", last sentence."]},{"h":"صَلُودٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", in six places. ― -b2- Also, applied to a well, ",[1,"Such that its mountain,"]," or ",[1,"rock, baffles the digger"]," [",[1,"by its hardness"],"], ",[1,"and resists his efforts."]," (M.) ― -b3- (tropical:) A she-camel ",[1,"having little,"]," or ",[1,"no, milk;"]," as also ↓ ",[2,"مِصْلَادٌ"],": (S, A, K:) and the latter, [which in the former case is written in some copies of the K with ",[2,"ة"],",] ",[1,"that has brought forth and has no milk."]," (K. [But this is said in the TA to be a repetition.]) ― -b4- (assumed tropical:) A woman ",[1,"in whom is little,"]," or ",[1,"no, good:"]," or ",[1,"hard, having no compassion in her heart."]," (M.) ― -b5- (tropical:) A cooking-pot (",[2,"قِدْرٌ"],") ",[1,"slow to boil."]," (S, M, A, K.) ― -b6- A beast (",[2,"دَابَّةٌ"],") ",[1,"that beats the ground with its fore feet in its running."]," (TA.) ― -b7- One ",[1,"who ascends a mountain by reason of fear;"]," (K, TA;) as also ↓ ",[2,"مِصْلَادٌ"],": (TA:) [or] a mountain-goat ",[1,"that ascends the mountain."]," (M.) ― -b8- And ",[1,"Alone, apart from others,"]," or ",[1,"separate;"]," (As, L, K;) as also ↓ ",[2,"صَلِيدٌ"],". (K.)"]},{"h":"صَلِيدٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", first sentence: ― -b2- and ",[2,"صَلُودٌ"],", last sentence. -A2- Also ",[1,"A shining, gleaming,"]," or ",[1,"glistening."]," (K.)"]},{"h":"صَلَّادٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", in two places; and ",[2,"مُصْلِدٌ"],"."]},{"h":"صُلَادِمٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", first sentence, in two places."]},{"h":"صَلَوْدَدٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", first sentence."]},{"h":"صَالِدٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],". ― -b2- ",[2,"أَنْيَابٌ صَالِدَةٌ"],[1,"Canine teeth causing a grating sound to be heard;"]," (K, * TA;) as also ",[2,"صَوَالِدُ"],", (K, TA,) which is the pl. (TA.)"]},{"h":"أَصْلَدُ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],", first sentence: ― -b2- and see the same also near the end of the paragraph."]},{"h":"مُصْلِدٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],". ― -b2- [Hence,] one says, ",[2,"لَيْسَ"],[2,"بِمُصْلِدِ القَدْحِ"]," [lit. ",[1,"He is not one whose wood gives only a sound when one endeavours to produce fire from it;"]," meaning (assumed tropical:) ",[1,"he is not one who ungenerously refuses when asked"],"]; an expression of praise; (TA in art. ",[2,"كسر"],";) and [in like manner] ",[2,"القَدْحِ"]," ↓ ",[2,"لَيْسَ بِصَلَّادِ"],". (TA. in art. ",[2,"هش"],".) -A2- Also Milk ",[1,"milked into a greasy vessel, and therefore without froth."]," (K.)"]},{"h":"مِصْلَادٌ","t":[": see ",[2,"صَلْدٌ"],": ― -b2- and ",[2,"صَلُودٌ"],", in two places."]}]},"maqayis":["الصاد واللام والدال أصل واحد صحيح، يدل على صلابة ويبس. من ذلك الحجر الصلد، وهو الصلب. ثم يحمل [عليه] قولهم: صلد الزند، إذا لم يخرج ناره. وأصلدته أنا. ومنه: الرأس الصلد الذي لا ينبت شعرا، كالأرض التي لا تنبت شيئا. قال رؤبة: براق أصلاد الجبين الأجله ويقال للبخيل: أصلد، فهو إما من المكان الذي لا ينبت، أو الزند الذي لا يوري. ويقال: ناقة صلود، أي بكيئة قليلة اللبن غليظة جلد الضرع. ومنه الفرس الصلود، وهو الذي لا يعرق. فإذا نتجت الناقة ولم يكن لها لبن قيل ناقة مصلاد."],"mufradat":["قال تعالى: فتركه صلدا [البقرة/ 264] ، أي: حجرا صلبا وهو لا ينبت، ومنه قيل: رأس صلد: لا ينبت شعرا، وناقة صلود ومصلاد: قليلة اللبن، وفرس صلود: لا يعرق، وصلد الزند: لا يخرج ناره."]}